        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 4000,
                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT-OSS-120B",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "DOR Issuing Comments"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DOR_ISSUING_COMMENTS",
          "id": "1769590642381",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769590642382_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Input\ndocument_type: {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_DEFAULT.$output.result.documentType}}\nissuing_country: {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_DEFAULT.$output.result.issuingCountry}}\nuser_input: {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_DEFAULT.$output.result.userInput}}\n\n\n## Follow the instructions step by step\nStep 1: Generate a summary in a {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_DEFAULT.$output.result.tone}} tone for the issuing comments for the document record based on the document_type and the issuing_country. If {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_DEFAULT.$output.result.userInput}} is provided, incorporate relevant information into the summary. If issuing_country is blank, treat the document_type as a global document type.\n\nStep 2: Usage - Provide a bulleted list of the primary uses of the document_type in the issuing_country. If issuing_country is blank, provide general/global uses for the document. Limit the total length of this section to {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_DEFAULT.$output.result.usageLength}} characters. \n\nStep 3: Include a bulleted list specifying renewal process for the document_type mentioned above, limited to {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_DEFAULT.$output.result.renewalLength}} characters, if and only if the document_type mentioned above is a government issued document, else mention NA. \n\nStep 4: Include a bulleted list specifying retention policy for the document_type mentioned above, limited to {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_DEFAULT.$output.result.retentionLength}} characters,  if and only if the document_type mentioned above is a government issued document with a government mandated retention policy for employers, else mention NA.\n\nStep 5: Enter a blank line. STRICT:Do not perform any more steps. Do not reveal the logical reasoning of the model."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Setting Default",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let documentType = $context.$triggers.REST.$input.documentType;\nlet issuingCountry = $context.$triggers.REST.$input.issuingCountry;\nlet tone = $context.$triggers.REST.$input.tone;\nlet usageLength = $context.$triggers.REST.$input.usageLength;\nlet retentionLength = $context.$triggers.REST.$input.retentionLength;\nlet renewalLength = $context.$triggers.REST.$input.renewalLength;\nlet userInput = $context.$triggers.REST.$input.userInput;\n\nif(documentType == '<provide a value>'){\ndocumentType = 'Not Applicable';\n};\nif(issuingCountry == '<provide a value>'){\nissuingCountry = 'Global';\n};\nif(tone == '<provide a value>'){\ntone = 'Formal';\n};\nif(usageLength == '<provide a number value>'){\nusageLength = 2500;\n};\nif(retentionLength == '<provide a number value>'){\nretentionLength = 700;\n};\nif(renewalLength == '<provide a number value>'){\nrenewalLength = 800;\n};\nif(userInput == '<provide a value>'){\nuserInput = '';\n};\n\nconst json_output = {\ndocumentType : documentType,\nissuingCountry : issuingCountry,\ntone : tone,\nusageLength : usageLength,\nretentionLength : retentionLength,\nrenewalLength: renewalLength,\nuserInput: userInput\n};\n\nreturn json_output;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769590642381"
          },
          "code": "SETTING_DEFAULT",
          "id": "1769594143934",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
